WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.361 --> 00:00:04.328
&gt;&gt; Tucker: GOOD EVENING.

00:00:04.329 --> 00:00:05.362
WELCOME TO "TUCKER CARLSON

00:00:05.363 --> 00:00:05.729
TONIGHT."

