THERE IS A NEW CONGRESS HERE

00:00:08.199 --> 00:00:09.399
IN WASHINGTON.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.601
BUT THE GOVERNMENT SHUTDOWN

00:00:10.602 --> 00:00:11.235
