00:00:11.236 --> 00:00:12.703
THE STALEMATE OVER THE BORDER

00:00:12.704 --> 00:00:14.771
WALL FUNDING ENTERED THE THIRD

00:00:14.772 --> 00:00:15.105
WEEK.

00:00:15.106 --> 00:00:16.240
EACH SIDE BETTING THE OTHER

00:00:16.241 --> 00:00:18.108
WILL GIVE IN FIRST.

00:00:18.109 --> 00:00:18.909
NEGOTIATIONS CONTINUE AT THE

00:00:18.910 --> 00:00:20.410
WHITE HOUSE TODAY BUT

00:00:20.411 --> 00:00:22.212
APPARENTLY THEY BORE NO FRUIT.

00:00:22.213 --> 00:00:22.946
BECAUSE AFTERWARDS THE

00:00:22.947 --> 00:00:24.181
PRESIDENT EMERGED TO SAY THE

00:00:24.182 --> 00:00:25.816
SITUATION ON THE SOUTHERN

00:00:25.817 --> 00:00:27.384
BORDER IS SO GRAVE HE MAY BE

00:00:27.385 --> 00:00:29.086
FORCED TO BUILD A WALL WITHOUT

00:00:29.087 --> 00:00:32.923
CONGRESSIONAL APPROVAL.

00:00:32.924 --> 00:00:34.258
&gt;&gt; HAVE YOU CONSIDERED USING

00:00:34.259 --> 00:00:35.559
EMERGENCY POWERS TO GRANT

00:00:35.560 --> 00:00:37.160
YOURSELF AUTHORITY TO BUILD

00:00:37.161 --> 00:00:38.295
THIS WALL WITHOUT

00:00:38.296 --> 00:00:39.429
CONGRESSIONAL APPROVAL?

00:00:39.430 --> 00:00:40.163
AND SECOND --

00:00:40.164 --> 00:00:41.565
&gt;&gt; YES, I HAVE.

00:00:41.566 --> 00:00:42.065
&gt;&gt; YOU HAVE?

00:00:42.066 --> 00:00:42.733
&gt;&gt; President Trump: I HAVE.

00:00:42.734 --> 00:00:44.601
I CAN DO IT IF I WANT.

00:00:44.602 --> 00:00:45.903
&gt;&gt; SO YOU DON'T NEED

00:00:45.904 --> 00:00:47.571
CONGRESSIONAL APPROVAL?

00:00:47.572 --> 00:00:48.305
&gt;&gt; President Trump: NO.

00:00:48.306 --> 00:00:49.506
WE CAN CALL A NATIONAL

00:00:49.507 --> 00:00:50.507
EMERGENCY BECAUSE OF THE

00:00:50.508 --> 00:00:51.508
SECURITY OF THE COUNTRY.

00:00:51.509 --> 00:00:51.909
ABSOLUTELY.

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:52.743
NO WE CAN DO IT.

00:00:52.744 --> 00:00:53.644
I HAVEN'T DONE IT.

00:00:53.645 --> 00:00:55.646
I MAY DO IT.

00:00:55.647 --> 00:00:57.648
BUT WE CAN CALL A NATIONAL

00:00:57.649 --> 00:01:02.052
EMERGENCY AND BUILD IT

00:01:02.053 --> 00:01:02.519
QUICKLY.

00:01:02.520 --> 00:01:05.422
&gt;&gt; Tucker: DEMOCRATS CALL

00:01:05.423 --> 00:01:07.024
THAT EXTREMISM.

00:01:07.025 --> 00:01:07.958
WHO ARE EXTREME?

00:01:07.959 --> 00:01:10.661
THE ONE WHO REFUSE TO DEFEND

00:01:10.662 --> 00:01:12.262
THEIR COUNTRY.

00:01:12.263 --> 00:01:13.764
