00:01:13.765 --> 00:01:16.433
THEY WILL NEVER ALLOCATE A

00:01:16.434 --> 00:01:17.701
SINGLE TAX DOLLAR TO BUILD A

00:01:17.702 --> 00:01:18.735
BORDER WALL.

00:01:18.736 --> 00:01:20.137
NOT BECAUSE IT'S TOO

00:01:20.138 --> 00:01:20.771
EXPENSIVE, THESE ARE THE

00:01:20.772 --> 00:01:21.204
DEMOCRATS.

00:01:21.205 --> 00:01:23.106
BUT A WALL WOULD VIOLATE A

00:01:23.107 --> 00:01:24.408
PREVIOUSLY UNKNOWN AND NEVER

00:01:24.409 --> 00:01:25.409
EXPLAINED MORAL CODE.

00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:25.809
WATCH.

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:29.212
&gt;&gt; THE FACT IS A WALL IS AN

00:01:29.213 --> 00:01:29.713
IMMORALITY.

00:01:29.714 --> 00:01:31.548
IT'S NOT WHO WE ARE AS A

00:01:31.549 --> 00:01:31.915
NATION.

00:01:31.916 --> 00:01:37.387
IT'S AN OLD WAY OF THINKING.

00:01:37.388 --> 00:01:38.889
&gt;&gt; Tucker: IT'S TEMPTING TO

00:01:38.890 --> 00:01:39.790
ASSUME THAT THE SPEAKER

00:01:39.791 --> 00:01:40.324
MISSPOKEN THERE.

00:01:40.325 --> 00:01:41.858
BUT IT'S HARDLY THE FIRST TIME

00:01:41.859 --> 00:01:42.993
SHE SAID IT.

00:01:42.994 --> 00:01:43.994
IMMORAL.

00:01:43.995 --> 00:01:44.394
IMMORALITY.

00:01:44.395 --> 00:01:46.863
SHE USED THE WORDS REPEATEDLY.

00:01:46.864 --> 00:01:48.398
DEMOCRAT IS THE HIGHEST

00:01:48.399 --> 00:01:49.232
RANKING DEMOCRAT IN THE UNITED

00:01:49.233 --> 00:01:49.566
STATES.

00:01:49.567 --> 00:01:51.068
THE LEADER OF HER PARTY.

00:01:51.069 --> 00:01:52.469
SO WE SHOULD NOT BLOW IT OFF.

00:01:52.470 --> 00:01:53.670
WE SHOULD TAKE IT SERIOUSLY.

00:01:53.671 --> 00:01:55.405
AS A MATTER OF POLICY,

00:01:55.406 --> 00:01:56.873
DEMOCRATS BELIEVE A BORDER

00:01:56.874 --> 00:01:58.108
WALL IS IMMORAL.

00:01:58.109 --> 00:01:59.810
THAT RAISES THE QUESTION WHAT

00:01:59.811 --> 00:02:01.712
DO THEY CONSIDER MORAL?

00:02:01.713 --> 00:02:03.046
WELL, AMERICAN TROOPS STUCK

00:02:03.047 --> 00:02:04.081
FOREVER IN SYRIA FOR ONE

00:02:04.082 --> 00:02:04.414
THING.

