THAT IS JUST FINE.

00:02:07.819 --> 00:02:08.752
SEX-SELECTIVE ABORTIONS PAID

00:02:08.753 --> 00:02:10.887
FOR WITH THE TAX DOLLARS.

00:02:10.888 --> 00:02:13.323
CAN'T GET MORE MORAL THAN

00:02:13.324 --> 00:02:13.690
THAT.

00:02:13.691 --> 00:02:16.860
AN TIFF FA IN -- AND ANTIFA IN

00:02:16.861 --> 00:02:18.295
THE STREET IS ALL PERFECTLY

00:02:18.296 --> 00:02:19.529
MORAL.

00:02:19.530 --> 00:02:21.365
WALLS CAN BE MORAL IN THE

00:02:21.366 --> 00:02:23.400
RIGHT CIRCUMSTANCES BUT CAN'T

00:02:23.401 --> 00:02:23.900
PROTECT AMERICA.

00:02:23.901 --> 00:02:26.570
THEY SIGNED OFF FOR BORDERS IN

00:02:26.571 --> 00:02:27.738
ISRAEL, EGYPT AND JORDAN.

00:02:27.739 --> 00:02:28.271
NO PROBLEM.

00:02:28.272 --> 00:02:30.173
BUT HERE ON BEHALF OF OUR OWN

00:02:30.174 --> 00:02:31.108
PEOPLE NO.

00:02:31.109 --> 00:02:32.509
AMERICANS DON'T DESERVE THAT.

00:02:32.510 --> 00:02:37.147
THEY ARE IMMORAL FOR ASKING.

00:02:37.148 --> 00:02:38.882
THOSE ARE THE PARAMETERS TO

00:02:38.883 --> 00:02:40.450
THE MORALITY.

00:02:40.451 --> 00:02:42.019
WHAT RELIGION IS THIS EXACTLY?

00:02:42.020 --> 00:02:44.221
WE ARE JOINED BY AN ATTORNEY,

00:02:44.222 --> 00:02:46.289
RADIO HOST, FORMER AIDE TO

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:47.491
CHUCK SCHUMER AND HE JOINS US

00:02:47.492 --> 00:02:47.824
TONIGHT.

00:02:47.825 --> 00:02:49.059
IF YOU WOULD, I THINK WE

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:50.160
TALKED ABOUT THIS BEFORE.

00:02:50.161 --> 00:02:51.728
NANCY PELOSI REPEATEDLY CALLED

00:02:51.729 --> 00:02:55.365
