00:07:30.041 --> 00:07:31.207
COUNTRIES SOME OF WHICH WOULD

00:07:31.208 --> 00:07:32.676
GO TO BORDER SECURITY.

00:07:32.677 --> 00:07:34.044
WE FUNDED WITH HER APPROVAL

00:07:34.045 --> 00:07:35.578
BORDER SECURITY AND WALLS IN A

00:07:35.579 --> 00:07:37.280
BUNCH OF OTHER COUNTRIES.

00:07:37.281 --> 00:07:39.049
WHY WERE THOSE NOT IMMORAL BUT

00:07:39.050 --> 00:07:41.117
OUR WALL IS IMMORAL?

00:07:41.118 --> 00:07:42.185
&gt;&gt; WELL, WHEN WE TALK ABOUT

00:07:42.186 --> 00:07:43.887
THE ISRAELI WALL, AND OTHER

00:07:43.888 --> 00:07:44.888
COUNTRIES THAT HAVE THE WALLS

00:07:44.889 --> 00:07:46.289
LIKE THAT, THEY ARE IN A

00:07:46.290 --> 00:07:47.590
CONSTANT STATE OF THE WAR WITH

00:07:47.591 --> 00:07:48.024
THE NEIGHBOR.

00:07:48.025 --> 00:07:50.193
WE ARE NOT IN A STATE OF WAR

00:07:50.194 --> 00:07:51.027
WITH MEXICO.

00:07:51.028 --> 00:07:51.795
&gt;&gt; Tucker: NOT TRUE.

00:07:51.796 --> 00:07:53.630
&gt;&gt; WE ARE NOT HAVING A TRY

00:07:53.631 --> 00:07:55.231
ANALYSIS OF THE BORDER --

00:07:55.232 --> 00:07:56.666
CRISIS OF THE BORDER.

00:07:56.667 --> 00:07:58.068
PEOPLE DON'T LOB BOMBS FROM

00:07:58.069 --> 00:07:59.035
THE COUNTRY FROM MEXICO.

00:07:59.036 --> 00:08:00.603
THEY ARE THE BIGGEST TRADING

00:08:00.604 --> 00:08:01.037
PARTNER.

00:08:01.038 --> 00:08:01.638
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I UNDERSTAND

00:08:01.639 --> 00:08:01.938
THAT.

00:08:01.939 --> 00:08:03.373
THERE ARE A NUMBER OF BARRIERS

00:08:03.374 --> 00:08:04.641
IN ISRAEL, SOME OF THEM ARE

00:08:04.642 --> 00:08:06.176
DESIGNED TO KEEP TERRORISTS

00:08:06.177 --> 00:08:07.077
FROM COMING IN.

00:08:07.078 --> 00:08:08.378
I DON'T THINK ANYONE QUESTION

00:08:08.379 --> 00:08:09.379
THE RIGHT TO DO THAT.

00:08:09.380 --> 00:08:10.080
GOOD FOR THEM.

00:08:10.081 --> 00:08:11.481
BUT THERE IS ALSO A BORDER ON

00:08:11.482 --> 00:08:13.550
THE SOUTHERN BORDER OF EGYPT

00:08:13.551 --> 00:08:14.784
DESIGNED TO KEEP IMMIGRANTS

00:08:14.785 --> 00:08:16.252
FROM AFRICA OUT OF THEIR

00:08:16.253 --> 00:08:16.586
COUNTRY.

00:08:16.587 --> 00:08:18.388
I THINK IT'S ISRAEL'S RIGHT TO

00:08:18.389 --> 00:08:18.988
BUILD THE WALL.

00:08:18.989 --> 00:08:20.190
I WOULDN'T CONTEST THAT.

00:08:20.191 --> 00:08:21.124
I DON'T HAVE A PROBLEM WITH

00:08:21.125 --> 00:08:21.658
IT.

00:08:21.659 --> 00:08:22.492
BUT NANCY PELOSI DOESN'T HAVE

00:08:22.493 --> 00:08:24.194
A PROBLEM WITH IT EITHER.

00:08:24.195 --> 00:08:25.462
THAT WALL IS NOT IMMORAL.

00:08:25.463 --> 00:08:26.830
OUR WALL IS IMMORAL.

00:08:26.831 --> 00:08:28.064
I DON'T UNDERSTAND THAT.

00:08:28.065 --> 00:08:29.966
WHAT IS THE ANSWER?

00:08:29.967 --> 00:08:31.401
&gt;&gt; YOU KNOW, WE ARE A NATION

00:08:31.402 --> 00:08:31.768
OF.

00:08:31.769 --> 00:08:35.171
I -- OF IMMIGRANTS.

00:08:35.172 --> 00:08:39.509
IT MAKES US GREAT AND GIVES US

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:40.377
COMPETITIVE EDGE WITH THE REST

00:08:40.378 --> 00:08:40.877
OF THE WORLD.

00:08:40.878 --> 00:08:42.312
IF THE PRESIDENT AND THE PARTY

00:08:42.313 --> 00:08:43.580
WANT TO CHANGE THAT, THAT IS

00:08:43.581 --> 00:08:44.781
WHAT THEY SHOULD TALK ABOUT.

00:08:44.782 --> 00:08:46.349
BUT WHAT THEY ARE DOING

00:08:46.350 --> 00:08:47.984
DEMAGOGUING ABOUT A INVISIBLE

00:08:47.985 --> 00:08:50.053
THREAT THAT DOES NOT EXIST AT

00:08:50.054 --> 00:08:51.855
THE BORDERMENT.

00:08:51.856 --> 00:08:53.490
IT'S TIME TO STOP THAT AND

00:08:53.491 --> 00:08:54.891
HAVE A DISCUSSION ABOUT

00:08:54.892 --> 00:08:55.325
SECURITY.

00:08:55.326 --> 00:08:56.092
&gt;&gt; Tucker: HOW MANY PEOPLE

00:08:56.093 --> 00:08:57.060
ARE HERE ILLEGALLY IN THE

00:08:57.061 --> 00:08:57.560
UNITED STATES?

00:08:57.561 --> 00:08:58.628
DO YOU KNOW?

00:08:58.629 --> 00:09:02.332
&gt;&gt; I WOULD THINK OVER 10

00:09:02.333 --> 00:09:02.966
MILLION.

00:09:02.967 --> 00:09:04.234
10 TO 14 MILLION.

00:09:04.235 --> 00:09:05.869
&gt;&gt; Tucker: TRY OVER 20.

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:08.271
THIS IS AN ESTIMATE FROM THE

00:09:08.272 --> 00:09:09.639
IVY LEAGUE RESEARCHERS.

00:09:09.640 --> 00:09:10.940
DOES IT SEEM LIKE A LOT.

00:09:10.941 --> 00:09:13.443
DOES IT SEEM LIKE THE CURRENT

00:09:13.444 --> 00:09:14.644
BORDER SECURITY IS WORKING?

00:09:14.645 --> 00:09:15.779
&gt;&gt; IT SEEMS LIKE A LOT.

00:09:15.780 --> 00:09:18.047
IT SEEMS LIKE A LOT.

00:09:18.048 --> 00:09:20.417
90% OF THOSE PEOPLE, TUCKER,

00:09:20.418 --> 00:09:21.418
DID NOT CROSS THE SOUTHERN

00:09:21.419 --> 00:09:21.851
BORDER.

00:09:21.852 --> 00:09:24.320
&gt;&gt; HOW DO YOU KNOW THAT?

00:09:24.321 --> 00:09:25.588
&gt;&gt; THEY MAY HAVE COME HIRE ON

00:09:25.589 --> 00:09:26.956
A PLANE OR A BOAT.

00:09:26.957 --> 00:09:28.558
&gt;&gt; YOU DON'T KNOW THAT.

00:09:28.559 --> 00:09:29.659
YOU DON'T KNOW HOW MANY ARE

00:09:29.660 --> 00:09:30.026
HERE.

00:09:30.027 --> 00:09:32.028
HOW DO YOU KNOW HOW THEY GOT

00:09:32.029 --> 00:09:32.462
HERE?

00:09:32.463 --> 00:09:34.030
&gt;&gt; I WASN'T PREPARED FOR THAT

00:09:34.031 --> 00:09:34.998
QUESTION.

00:09:34.999 --> 00:09:35.932
BUT EVERY IVY LEAGUE STUDY I

00:09:35.933 --> 00:09:37.901
HAVE READ SHOWS EVERY IVY

00:09:37.902 --> 00:09:40.036
LEAGUE STUDY I READ ABOUT THE

00:09:40.037 --> 00:09:41.538
TOPIC SAYS THE SAME THING.

00:09:41.539 --> 00:09:43.173
MOST PEOPLE WHO ARE HERE

00:09:43.174 --> 00:09:44.641
ILLEGALLY OVERSTAYED THEIR

00:09:44.642 --> 00:09:45.141
VISAS.

00:09:45.142 --> 00:09:46.409
BUILDING A WALL AT THE

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:47.677
SOUTHERN BORDER IS NOT GOING

00:09:47.678 --> 00:09:49.546
TO CHANGE THAT.

00:09:49.547 --> 00:09:53.850
IT'S A WASTE OF MONEY.

00:09:53.851 --> 00:09:54.784
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WE ARE JUST

00:09:54.785 --> 00:09:56.353
GUESSING THAT IT'S NOT GOING

